      "content": "hey, quick question. i started taking sertraline (zoloft) a few weeks ago for my anxiety and its helping a lot, but i have this really bad dry cough from a cold and i can't stop coughing. is it okay if i take some of that generic cough syrup with dextromethorphan in it? just want to make sure there isnt anything i should avoid.",
